s\n*   BEAD program experience or familiarity with federal broadband funding requirements preferred\n*   Ability to manage junior staff and coordinate cross-functional teams\n\nBenefits\n\n*   Health Insurance (Medical, Dental, and Vision)\n*   401(K) \n*   Life Insurance and AD&D\n*   Supplemental Insurance\n*   Paid Time Off\n*   Employee Assistance Program\n*   Tuition Reimbursement\n\n[Apply for this Position](https://recruiting.paylocity.com/recruiting/jobs/Apply/3239107/LHTC-Broadband/Sr--Outside-Plant-Engineer)"
